<Layout title="Disclaimer">
    <section class="disclaimer-section">
        <h2 class="text-teal-400 my-1.5">Disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
            FossilGeo is an educational project and the information on this site is provided on a best-effort basis. What is available depends on regional
            coverage and third-party data sources. The main focus is the United Kingdom, but other regions may be supported in some cases.
        </p>
        <p>
            In some places, geographic or geological data may be limited, incomplete, out of date, or unavailable altogether. This can happen because of data
            restrictions, gaps in the source material, or connectivity problems.
        </p>
        <p>
            If you want to rely on any information from FossilGeo for study, fieldwork, or decision-making, you should check it against other trusted sources.
            FossilGeo and its contributors cannot guarantee that everything shown is complete, accurate, or current, and accept no liability for loss or damage
            resulting from use of the site.
        </p>
        <p>
            If something does not load properly, check your internet connection and try again later. For more information about coverage and data sources, see
            our <a href="/data-policy">Data Policy</a>.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-400 mt-2.5 italic">&copy; 2026 FossilGeo. All rights reserved.</p>
    </section>
</Layout>
